"A beast you attack or push becomes <b>aggro</b> on you: it follows you anywhere and attacks during your Resolve phase. Each NPC holds only one aggro target, the most recent gladiator to hit it. It still lashes out at anyone standing next to it. Tunnels, a Ward of the Evil Eye or a Meat Lure shake it off.":"Una bestia a la que atacas o empujas pasa a tener <b>aggro</b> sobre ti: te sigue a donde vayas y ataca durante tu fase Resolver. Cada NPC tiene un solo objetivo de aggro: el último gladiador que lo golpeó. Aun así arremete contra quien esté a su lado. Los túneles, un Ward of the Evil Eye o un Meat Lure te lo quitan de encima.",
