"Events last 53 turns on average: Democritus 52, Egidious 53, Cassian 55. Beasts slain per event: 7.5.":"Los eventos duran 53 turnos de media: Democritus 52, Egidious 53, Cassian 55. Bestias abatidas por evento: 7,5.",
"Events last {0} turns on average: Democritus {1}, Egidious {2}, Cassian {3}. Beasts slain per event: {4}.":"Los eventos duran {0} turnos de media: Democritus {1}, Egidious {2}, Cassian {3}. Bestias abatidas por evento: {4}.",
"Every 3 trophies held by a winner add 5 CF at the end. {0} in total.":"Cada 3 trofeos de un ganador suman 5 CF al final. {0} en total.",
